      "content": "It is incredibly draining to feel that you can no longer care about the \"little\" things that make up daily life, and that feeling of being emotionally exhausted is a sign you need to take a step back from the chaos.\n\nYou do not have to force yourself to believe in the \"movie\" just to stay alive; living a quiet life where you stop pretending to care about the noise might actually help you find a different kind of belonging.\n\nIf the exhaustion feels this heavy, please consider talking to a compassionate mental health professional who can help you navigate this disconnection without judgment.",
